 class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Is anybody waiting on you?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受け継ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うけつぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">继承；接任；接办</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112873\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>財産<rp>(</rp><rt>ざいさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>継<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぐ<ruby>資格<rp>(</rp><rt>しかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He has no claim to the property.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受付</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うけつけ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接待处；前台；接待员；咨询员；受理；接收</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"148365\"><ruby>受付<rp>(</rp><rt>うけつけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>入院<rp>(</rp><rt>にゅういん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>手続<rp>(</rp><rt>てつづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きをしてください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You have to fill out an application for admission to the hospital at the front desk.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">受け付ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">うけつける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接受；受理（申请）；承接；能够接受（饮食、药物等）；承受；忍受；耐受；遭受；受到影响；受损</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"